# The copied-in Next.js public website.
# It is NOT part of this demo - nothing in src/ imports from it, and the demo
# builds and runs without it. It is excluded from this repo for two reasons:
# it is ~900MB, and website/.env.local holds a live Firebase Admin private key
# for the real client project, which has no business being in a demo repo.
website/

# Belt and braces: no env file of any name, at any depth, ever gets committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
